  "question": {
    "text": "The angle between the lines joining the foci of an ellipse to one particular extremity of the minor axis is $90^{\\circ}$. The eccentricity of the ellipse is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "id": "XYMtU",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{8}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "ABLJt",
      "text": "$\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "TZ2Lu",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{3}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": false
    },
    {
      "id": "p2Tbe",
      "text": "$\\sqrt{\\frac{1}{2}}$",
      "image": null,
      "isCorrect": true
    }
  ],
  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "$$\n\\begin{gathered}\n\\text { } \\frac{b}{a e}=\\tan \\frac{\\pi}{4} \\\\\n\\qquad \\begin{array}{c}\na e \\Rightarrow \\frac{b}{a}=e \\\\\ne^2=1-\\frac{b^2}{a^2} \\\\\ne^2=1-e^2\n\\end{array}\n\\end{gathered}\n$$\n\n\n$$\ne^2=\\frac{1}{2} \\Rightarrow e=\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}}\n$$\n\n\n<img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/wbjee/jtBAd99n7EcmTx-TLfL5DNC2Occ2iDsJui9-Buwv6dk.original.fullsize.png\"><br>",
